`,h.jsx(c.p,{children:"I started by creating the skeleton of the card to figure out the layout. I wanted the card to be a composable where you can just pass in all the class information as parameters. At this point, we didn’t have a folder for the assets of the project, so I just used white boxes as placeholders and ended up with this:"}),`
